# clasp pushes everything it finds unless told otherwise, and this repo holds a
# docs site, a workflow and a test harness that must never reach Apps Script —
# site/index.html in particular would collide with Index.html.
#
# So: ignore everything, then allow back exactly the three files that are the
# Apps Script project. New folders are excluded by default rather than by
# remembering to add them here.
**/**

!appsscript.json
!Code.gs
!Index.html
